  "body_html": "<p>Marschall, dein Trupp ist standardmäßig ein halbes Dutzend stark. Behandle ihn als Gefolgsleute mit dem Merkmal <em>Gruppe</em> . Alle Startwerte hier können sich im Spiel ändern.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">Der Trupp</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Max. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Max. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Rüstung\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Rüstung</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Schaden\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Schaden würfeln\">Schaden</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">HP beginnen bei je 6, Rüstung bei 0, Schaden bei d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Merkmale</h3>\n<p>Dein Trupp startet mit <em>Gruppe</em>, einem Merkmal aus deinem Hintergrund, plus 2 weiteren deiner Wahl.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>Bogenschützen</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>athletisch</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>tapfer</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>gerissen</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>ergeben</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Beginnt angekreuzt\"> <span><em>Gruppe</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>abgehärtet</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>einschüchternd</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>aufmerksam</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>geduldig</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>angesehen</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>verstohlen</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>Krieger</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"selbst eintragen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"selbst eintragen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"selbst eintragen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>außergewöhnlich</em> (erfordert Helden bis Zuletzt)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Instinkt</h3>\n<p>Wähle 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>Zanken, streiten und nachtragend sein</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>An Tradition und Aberglauben festhalten</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>Ihren niederen Trieben nachgeben</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>Sich über andere erheben</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>Unnötige Risiken eingehen</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>Zu weit gehen</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"selbst eintragen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Preis</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Wähle 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Loyalität</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Loyalität 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Loyalität 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Loyalität 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Feiern, gemeinsam als Trupp</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Öffentliche Anerkennung und Respekt, Ehre</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Risiken, die du eingehst, um ihnen zu helfen</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Siege über würdige Feinde</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Reichtum für sie selbst oder Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"selbst eintragen\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Inventar</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ oder weniger sind eine leichte Last; 4–6 ◇ eine normale Last; 7–9 ◇ eine schwere Last.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Handbeil</strong>, Eisen (<em>Hand</em>, <em>geworfen</em>, x durchdringend)</li><li>◇ <strong>Speer</strong>, Eisen (<em>nah</em>, <em>geworfen</em>, x durchdringend)</li><li>◇ <strong>Bogen &amp; Eisenpfeile</strong> (<em>kurz</em>, x durchdringend, ○ Munition knapp, ○ aufgebraucht)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Schild</strong> (+1 Rüstung, +1 Bereitschaft bei 7+ beim Verteidigen)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Dicke Felle</strong> (1 Rüstung, <em>warm</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Umhang</strong> (<em>warm</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Vorräte</strong> (4+Wohlstand Anwendungen je Truppmitglied)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Vorräte</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Anwendung 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Anwendung 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Anwendung 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Anwendung 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Anwendung 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Anwendung 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Anwendung 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Anwendung 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Anwendung 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Anwendung 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Anwendung 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Anwendung 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Anwendung 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Anwendung 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Anwendung 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Anwendung 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Anwendung 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"Anwendung 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"Anwendung 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"Anwendung 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"Anwendung 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"Anwendung 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"Anwendung 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"Anwendung 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"Anwendung 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Sonstige Ausrüstung</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">Die Einzelnen</h3>\n<p>Wenn sich jemand hervortut, gib ihm einen Namen, ein Merkmal und eine oder mehrere Eigenheiten.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Name</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"Name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkmal</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"Merkmal\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Eigenheiten</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"Eigenheiten\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Name</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"Name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkmal</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"Merkmal\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Eigenheiten</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"Eigenheiten\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Name</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"Name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkmal</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"Merkmal\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Eigenheiten</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"Eigenheiten\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Name</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"Name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkmal</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"Merkmal\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Eigenheiten</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"Eigenheiten\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Name</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"Name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkmal</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"Merkmal\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Eigenheiten</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"Eigenheiten\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Name</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"Name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkmal</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"Merkmal\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Eigenheiten</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"Eigenheiten\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Namen:</strong> Aled, Culhwich, Eira, Gerat, Glaw, Harri, Lowri, Mervyn, Nesta</p>\n<p><strong>Merkmale:</strong> <em>Tierfreund, groß, Tyrann, zynisch, Trinker, eifrig, Spieler, gierig, griesgrämig, leichtgläubig, Herzensbrecher, ehrlich, freundlich, anzüglich, klein, naiv, alt, beliebt, stolz, Neuling, waghalsig, schamlos, scharfäugig, aufbrausend</em></p>\n<p><strong>Eigenheiten:</strong> Kind/Geschwister/Elternteil/Cousin von ___, kahl, verknallt in ___, Groll gegen ___, hasst ___, vergöttert ___, reißt Witze, unordentlich, fehlendes Auge/Finger/Hand/___, vermisst die eigenen Kinder, Albträume, frisch verheiratet, fromm, Narben, dürr, scharfzüngig, singt, schnarcht, erzählt Räuberpistolen, zu ernst, Ärger daheim, pfeift, Schnitzer</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notizen</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notizen\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">Gefolgsleute befehligen</h3>\n<p>Wenn du <strong><em>ihnen aufträgst, einen Spielzug zu machen, und sie das tun</em></strong>, würfle +1 statt +STAT, falls eines ihrer Merkmale zutrifft (oder +2, wenn sie zudem <em>außergewöhnlich</em> sind). Trifft kein Merkmal zu, würfle +0. Stünde eines ihrer Merkmale im Weg, würfle mit Nachteil.</p>\n<p>Wenn sie <strong><em>ohne Befehle</em></strong> sind oder <strong><em>aus eigenem Antrieb handeln</em></strong>, sagt die SL, was sie tun und wie es ausgeht.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">Stärke euer Band</h3>\n<p>Wenn du <strong><em>ihren Preis zahlst</em></strong> und das nicht erst kürzlich getan hast, erhalten sie +1 Loyalität (max. 3).</p>\n<p>Gib ihre Loyalität 1-zu-1 aus, damit sie:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Ihre Furcht überwinden und tun, was du sagst</li><li>Es unterlassen, nach Instinkt/Merkmalen/Eigenheiten zu handeln</li><li>Etwas tun, das sie nicht tun wollen (solange es nicht abscheulich oder selbstmörderisch ist)</li></ul>"
}
